<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="544247584"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1460747047"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Strawberries &amp; Cigarettes"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Troye Sivan"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Love, Simon (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:15.035"><div begin="00:12.774" end="03:15.235"><p begin="00:12.774" end="00:15.118" itunes:key="L762">Remember when we first met?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得我们初次相遇时</span></p><p begin="00:15.356" end="00:17.492" itunes:key="L763">You said, "Light my cigarette"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说 给我点支烟吧</span></p><p begin="00:18.268" end="00:20.713" itunes:key="L764">So I lied to my mum and dad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我向父母撒了谎</span></p><p begin="00:21.457" end="00:23.873" itunes:key="L765">I jumped the fence and I ran<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偷偷跳出篱笆 溜了出去</span></p><p begin="00:24.158" end="00:26.710" itunes:key="L766">But we couldn't go very far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们似乎无法走远</span></p><p begin="00:26.920" end="00:29.726" itunes:key="L767">'Cause you locked your keys in your car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为 你把钥匙锁在车里了</span></p><p begin="00:29.835" end="00:32.286" itunes:key="L768">So you sat and stared at my lips<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以你坐下来 凝望着我的双唇</span></p><p begin="00:32.506" end="00:34.500" itunes:key="L769">And I could already feel your kiss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经感受到你亲吻的气息了</span></p><p begin="00:34.510" end="00:37.094" itunes:key="L770">Long nights, daydreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫漫长夜 幻梦不断</span></p><p begin="00:37.299" end="00:39.839" itunes:key="L771">Sugar and smoke rings<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嚼着糖 吐着烟圈 我似乎成了大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="00:39.867" end="00:41.256" itunes:key="L2220">I've been a fool</p><p begin="00:41.455" end="00:44.064" itunes:key="L772">But strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="00:44.391" end="00:45.886" itunes:key="L2716">Always taste like you</p><p begin="00:45.912" end="00:48.443" itunes:key="L773">Headlights on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开车前灯</span></p><p begin="00:48.693" end="00:51.208" itunes:key="L774">Racing to 60<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开到六十码 我俨然一个大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="00:51.264" end="00:52.758" itunes:key="L3333">I've been a fool</p><p begin="00:52.905" end="00:55.307" itunes:key="L775">Strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="00:55.854" end="00:57.211" itunes:key="L4246">Always taste like</p><p begin="00:57.285" end="00:59.920" itunes:key="L776">Blue eyes, black jeans<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓝色明眸 黑色牛仔</span></p><p begin="01:00.138" end="01:02.840" itunes:key="L777">Lighters and candy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打火机和糖果 我真是个大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="01:02.850" end="01:04.162" itunes:key="L4769">I've been a fool</p><p begin="01:04.256" end="01:06.917" itunes:key="L778">But strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="01:07.263" end="01:09.428" itunes:key="L5301">Always taste like you</p><p begin="01:09.999" end="01:12.023" itunes:key="L779">Remember when you taught me fate?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得你跟我讲命运的时候</span></p><p begin="01:12.679" end="01:14.607" itunes:key="L780">Said it'd all be worth the wait<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说这一切都值得等候</span></p><p begin="01:15.481" end="01:18.118" itunes:key="L781">Like that night in the back of the cab<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像在深夜的车后座上</span></p><p begin="01:18.360" end="01:20.991" itunes:key="L782">When your fingers walked in my hand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们勾着手指</span></p><p begin="01:21.292" end="01:23.872" itunes:key="L783">Next day, nothin' on my phone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第二天我的手机上没有你的信息</span></p><p begin="01:23.980" end="01:26.688" itunes:key="L784">But I can still smell you on my clothes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我的衣服上还残留着你的气息</span></p><p begin="01:26.956" end="01:29.771" itunes:key="L785">Always hoping that things would change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直希望一切能有所改观</span></p><p begin="01:29.781" end="01:31.593" itunes:key="L786">But we went right back to your games<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们还是又陷入你游戏的圈套</span></p><p begin="01:31.603" end="01:34.190" itunes:key="L787">Long nights, daydreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长夜漫漫 幻梦不断</span></p><p begin="01:34.445" end="01:36.856" itunes:key="L788">Sugar and smoke rings<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嚼着糖 吐着烟圈 我俨然一个大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="01:37.000" end="01:38.594" itunes:key="L789">I've been a fool</p><p begin="01:38.644" end="01:41.209" itunes:key="L6742">But strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="01:41.564" end="01:42.956" itunes:key="L6743">Always taste like you</p><p begin="01:42.981" end="01:45.536" itunes:key="L790">Headlights on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开车前灯</span></p><p begin="01:45.821" end="01:48.288" itunes:key="L791">Racing to 60<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开到六十码 我真是个大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="01:48.373" end="01:50.026" itunes:key="L792">I've been a fool</p><p begin="01:50.152" end="01:52.520" itunes:key="L6744">Strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="01:52.947" end="01:54.283" itunes:key="L6745">Always taste like</p><p begin="01:54.469" end="01:57.064" itunes:key="L793">Blue eyes, black jeans<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓝色明眸 黑色牛仔</span></p><p begin="01:57.214" end="01:59.629" itunes:key="L794">Lighters and candy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打火机和糖果 我真是个大傻瓜</span></p><p begin="01:59.732" end="02:01.399" itunes:key="L795">I've been a fool</p><p begin="02:01.449" end="02:04.121" itunes:key="L6746">But strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="02:04.443" end="02:06.694" itunes:key="L6747">Always taste like you</p><p begin="02:07.192" end="02:09.718" itunes:key="L796">And even if I run away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我暂时逃避一切</span></p><p begin="02:10.107" end="02:12.481" itunes:key="L797">Give my heart a holiday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就给我的心放个假吧</span></p><p begin="02:12.599" end="02:15.551" itunes:key="L798">Still, strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">草莓和香烟还是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="02:15.829" end="02:17.874" itunes:key="L6748">Always taste like you</p><p begin="02:18.605" end="02:21.026" itunes:key="L799">You always leave me wanting more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是让我渴望更多</span></p><p begin="02:21.537" end="02:24.167" itunes:key="L800">I can't shake my hunger for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法打消对你的渴望</span></p><p begin="02:24.407" end="02:26.975" itunes:key="L801">Strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="02:27.284" end="02:29.495" itunes:key="L6749">Always taste like you</p><p begin="02:32.635" end="02:38.491" itunes:key="L802">Yeah, they always taste like you, you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是与你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="02:40.123" end="02:43.109" itunes:key="L803">Long nights, daydreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长夜漫漫 幻梦不断</span></p><p begin="02:45.012" end="02:49.369" itunes:key="L804">With that sugar and smoke rings<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嚼着糖 吐着烟圈</span></p><p begin="02:50.121" end="02:51.469" itunes:key="L805">Always taste like you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像你味道一样</span></p><p begin="02:51.498" end="02:54.508" itunes:key="L806">Headlights on me (And even if I run away)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开车前灯</span></p><p begin="02:54.518" end="02:56.907" itunes:key="L808">Racing to 60<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我暂时逃避一切</span></p><p begin="02:56.978" end="02:58.215" itunes:key="L6750">I've been a fool (Give my heart a holiday)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就给我的心放个假吧</span></p><p begin="02:58.559" end="03:01.241" itunes:key="L810">Still, strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">草莓和香烟还是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="03:01.500" end="03:02.921" itunes:key="L6751">Always taste like</p><p begin="03:03.008" end="03:05.821" itunes:key="L811">Blue eyes, black jeans (You always leave me wanting more)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓝色明眸 黑色牛仔</span></p><p begin="03:05.865" end="03:08.318" itunes:key="L813">Lighters and candy (I can't shake my hunger for)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是让我渴望更多</span></p><p begin="03:08.328" end="03:09.948" itunes:key="L6752">I've been a fool<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法打消对你的渴望</span></p><p begin="03:09.958" end="03:12.506" itunes:key="L815">Strawberries and cigarettes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">草莓和香烟总是和你的味道很像</span></p><p begin="03:13.003" end="03:15.235" itunes:key="L6753">Always taste like you</p></div></body></tt>